</span>



        <span class="we-customer-review__separator">, </span>

        
      </h3>

        <blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive  we-customer-review__body" dir>
        

        <p dir="false" data-test-bidi>Hey there,<br /><br />Thank you so much for the awesome review and your feedback. I am currently working on a cross-device sync functionality and hope to release it this year!<br />More reminder/notification configuration options are also on the roadmap and will be implemented with a future version of the app.<br />Ultimately, some form of &quot;categories&quot; will come with the next big update, so very soon. Stay tuned for that.<br /><br />Thanks for the great points!</p>
    


<!----></blockquote>


