 Store\",\"name\":\"Productivity\",\"parentId\":\"36\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id6007\"}},{\"id\":\"6013\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/genres/6013?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"name\":\"Health \u0026 Fitness\",\"parentId\":\"36\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id6013\"}}]}},\"meta\":{\"contentVersion\":{\"MZ_INDEXER\":1731729073445,\"RTCI\":1731364329876}}},{\"id\":\"1111447047\",\"type\":\"apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1111447047?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"distributionKind\":\"APP_STORE\",\"supportsArcade\":false,\"isFirstPartyHideableApp\":false,\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"privacyType\":\"Data Not Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"4+\",\"value\":100,\"rank\":1}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"mac\",\"watch\",\"iphone\",\"ipad\",\"ipod\"],\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":true,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/habitify-habit-tracker/id1111447047\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4.6,\"ratingCount\":5542,\"ratingCountList\":[258,89,219,534,4442],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.6 stars\"},\"watchBundleId\":\"co.vuvo.habitify.appexwatchkitapp\",\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"3.4\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Productivity\",\"name\":\"Habitify - Habit Tracker\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"artistName\":\"Unstatic Ltd Co\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires macOS 11.0 or later.\"},\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iPadOS 15.6 or later.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 15.6 or later.\"},\"watch\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Watch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires watchOS 8.7 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 15.6 or later.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires visionOS 1.0 or later.\"}},\"minimumWatchOSVersion\":\"8.7\",\"platformAttributes\":{\"osx\":{\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Habitify is a user-friendly habit tracker that simplifies personal growth. It's designed to keep you inspired and focused as you elevate your everyday habits and lifestyle effortlessly.\\n\\nWHY CHOOSE HABITIFY FOR YOUR HABIT-BUILDING JOURNEY?\\n\\n1. Streamlined Habit Organization\\nEffortlessly create and categorize habits based on the time of day and different aspects of your life to seamlessly integrate them into your daily routine.\\n\\n2. Never Miss a Habit with Smart Reminders\\nOur intelligent reminder system not only alerts you when it's time for a habit, but also keeps you motivated and prepared to tackle it head-on.\\n\\n3. Boost Your Motivation with Streaks\\nAccurately track your progress and build impressive streaks of habit completion. The longer your streak, the more driven you'll be to maintain it.\\n\\n4. Understand Your Habits to Enhance Performance\\nGain insight into your habits through detailed statistics, including daily performance, completion trends, rates, averages, and totals.\\n\\n5. Automate Tracking with Apple Health Sync\\nConnect Habitify to Apple Health for automatic updates on steps, calories, and exercise minutes, all recorded within the app via HealthKit.\\n\\nKEY FEATURES\\n- Comprehensive habit management\\n- Customizable habit display and organization\\n- Smart reminder system\\n- In-depth habit statistics and tracking\\n- Reflective habit notes\\n- Cross-device syncing for iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch, and Mac\\n\\nSUBSCRIPTION PRICING AND TERMS\\nHabitify is available for free on all platforms. Once you've purchased on one platform, enjoy Premium access across all other platforms at no additional cost.\\n\\nNote: Prices are for US customers. Pricing in other countries may vary and charges may be converted to your local currency depending on your country of residence.\\n\\n1 Month: $4.99\\n12 Months: $34.99\\nLifetime: $64.99\\nChoose from two auto-renewing subscriptions or a lifetime subscription to suit your budget. Subscriptions automatically renew at the end of each term and will be charged to your iTunes account unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\\n\\nHEALTH DATA\\nHabitify allows you to create habits and sync your Health data with the app. We do not store any health data on our servers.\\n\\nTerms of Use: https://habitify.me/terms-of-use\\nPrivacy Policy: https://habitify.me/privacy-policy\\n\\nWe at Habitify value your ideas, feedback, and suggestions. Connect with us:\\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/habitify/\\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/UseHabitify\\nEmail: contact@habitify.me\\nCommunity: https://habitify.me/community\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.2.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Feature Parity with iOS: Our macOS app is now fully in sync with the iOS version. Enjoy all the latest features and enhancements across your Apple devices.\\n- View Your Progress on macOS: Tracking your habits gets even better! Now view your progress directly on your macOS app, making it easier to stay on top of your goals.\\n- Bug Fixes and Stability Improvements: We've ironed out several bugs and resolved crashes to ensure a smoother, more reliable Habitify experience on your Mac.\\n\\nDive into these updates and keep your habit-tracking game strong, whether you’re on the move with your iPhone or at your desk with your Mac.\\n\\nThanks for being a part of our Habitify family. Here’s to seamless habit tracking across all your devices!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-22T08:58:14Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.0.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fixed sync issues with Phone version. \\nWe're sorry for this long delayed update for macOS users. From now on, Habitify macOS will be synced updates with its iOS version.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-21T06:14:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.0.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fixed sync issues with Phone version. \\nWe're sorry for this long delayed update for macOS users. From now on, Habitify macOS will be synced updates with its iOS version.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-20T02:32:15Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"10.1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and overall performance improved\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-07-19\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-07-19T22:00:45Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"10.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Habitify Mini is now working again on Big Sur\\n- Added Colors, icon for Area\\n- Habitify for macOS now localized into 16 languages\\n- Bugs fixes and overall performance improved\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-01-14\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-01-14T19:29:30Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"10.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Added goal settings for habit\\n- Added Overall Progress screen\\n- Fixed app badge doesn't show the pending habits\\n- Overall performance \u0026 stability improved\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-10-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-10-24T23:07:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.4.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Premium member now can add multiple reminder.\\n- Journal now will always show the progress when you click the item, not freezing anymore.\\n- Reminder now firing even when the app is running\\n- Some other minor bugs fixing and improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-06-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-06-10T02:10:45Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.4.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"In this version, we've improved the app stability and added some improvements of Habitify Mini:\\n- Habitify Mini is now keep running on background even when all window closed\\n- Improved Habitify Mini stability.\\n- Some crash has been fixed. Please contact us if you still experience crash in this version.\\n- Sidebar is now collapsable.\\n- Synchronise purchases with mobile version when you signing in.\\n- Added Restore Purchases function on menu bar.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-05-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-05-24T02:46:34Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.4\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2020-05-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-05-15T01:16:47Z\"}],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://habitify.me/\",\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"editorialNotes\":{\"short\":\"Focus on the next tasks\",\"tagline\":\"Stay on track with your goals\"},\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1111447047\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=858418763\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":57458438}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1111447047\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=858418763\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":57458438}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2016-09-02\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"co.vuvo.habitify\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/1e/91/3f/1e913f52-e819-0345-8111-295ec0ce74db/AppIcon-0-2x_U007euniversal-4-0-85-220.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"fdfdfd\",\"textColor1\":\"00163d\",\"textColor2\":\"112f68\",\"textColor3\":\"324463\",\"textColor4\":\"405886\"},\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://habitify.me/privacy-policy\",\"videoPreviewsByType\":{},\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://habitify.me/\",\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":false,\"runsOnAppleSilicon\":true,\"requiresRosetta\":false,\"editorialArtwork\":{\"contentIconTrimmedMonochrome\":{\"width\":1048,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/6e/e2/e7/6ee2e7db-bf98-0d30-7adf-15aa80debeb5/721e011e-109f-4227-8978-1f8c6071c48f.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\"},\"contentIconTrimmed\":{\"width\":1048,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/09/15/89/091589bc-f33b-2d71-9e77-2ef3729cd955/abc2adb6-5a59-47b0-b8f5-84523bdd6bd8.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"0092ff\",\"textColor1\":\"00070c\",\"textColor2\":\"000e19\",\"textColor3\":\"00233d\",\"textColor4\":\"002947\"},\"brandLogo\":{\"width\":1080,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/1c/2b/7c/1c2b7cc6-e029-9bf9-f26f-4b5f533ee2fc/af8e3a5e-dba7-4ad7-9b94-9340366eab93.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\"},\"subscriptionHero\":{\"width\":4320,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features128/v4/ad/b8/ec/adb8ecc6-0e2d-37b4-09be-5f8cef530560/pr_source.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"fadf54\",\"textColor1\":\"14072f\",\"textColor2\":\"1d2a26\",\"textColor3\":\"423236\",\"textColor4\":\"494e2f\"}},\"subtitle\":\"Daily Routine \u0026 Goal Tracker\",\"preflightPackageUrl\":\"https://osxapps.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Purple126/v4/e6/6c/01/e66c0144-5774-19e0-1f6f-fc315e432919/wva12433559134157210071.pfpkg\",\"customAttributes\":{\"default\":{\"default\":{\"customVideoPreviewsByType\":{},\"customScreenshotsByType\":{\"mac\":[{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/29/ff/de/29ffde81-6e0a-1e19-fb45-23fa9b3cf445/3a48588e-c0d6-4539-bc8e-62635a0bcaf0_macOS_-_1.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"c5c6c8\",\"textColor1\":\"202121\",\"textColor2\":\"441255\",\"textColor3\":\"414242\",\"textColor4\":\"5e366c\"},{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/c1/b7/79/c1b77908-90d1-d686-6b53-f6bece443540/8d212023-1604-408d-a7c9-43eda3c93c10_macOS_02.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"c5c6c8\",\"textColor1\":\"070707\",\"textColor2\":\"111111\",\"textColor3\":\"2d2d2d\",\"textColor4\":\"353536\"},{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/21/e7/a8/21e7a87c-7020-7222-988f-c7db71681cbd/dae3912a-3aa0-4f68-b465-0354ced39cea_macOS_3.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"c5c6c8\",\"textColor1\":\"000713\",\"textColor2\":\"070707\",\"textColor3\":\"272d37\",\"textColor4\":\"2d2d2d\"}]}}}},\"runsOnIntel\":true},\"ios\":{\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Take the guesswork out of personal growth. Habitify is the all-in-one habit tracker designed to help you establish and maintain productive routines. Whether you’re hoping to read more, exercise regularly, or boost your daily mindfulness, Habitify empowers you with the tools and insights you need to stay motivated and consistent.\\n\\n# Key Features\\n1. Simple, Intuitive Design\\n- Effortlessly add, organize, and track habits with a clean interface that gets out of your way.\\n\\n2. Powerful Reminders\\n- Never miss a habit again! Set multiple reminders for each habit to keep you on track throughout the day.\\n\\n3. Data-Driven Insights\\n- Visualize your progress with detailed stats and streak charts, so you always know how far you’ve come—and what to improve.\\n\\n4. Personalized Habit Plans\\n- Create custom routines for different areas of your life: fitness, study, self-care, productivity, and more.\\n\\n5. Multi-Device Sync\\n- Stay connected across all your devices, ensuring you can log your progress anytime, anywhere.\\n\\n# Why You’ll Love Habitify\\nAchieve Consistency: Build streaks and measure your success to form habits that truly stick.\\nStay Motivated: Celebrate milestones and track your momentum with clear, measurable progress.\\nReduce Overwhelm: Focus on a few key habits each day using Habitify’s minimalist approach.\\nBalance Work \u0026 Life: Set routines that keep your mind and body healthy, organized, and stress-free.\\n\\n---------\\nSUBSCRIPTION PRICING AND TERMS\\nHabitify is available for free on all platforms. Once you've purchased on one platform, enjoy Premium access across all other platforms at no additional cost.\\n\\nNote: Prices are for US customers. Pricing in other countries may vary and charges may be converted to your local currency depending on your country of residence.\\n\\n1 Month: $4.99\\n12 Months: $34.99\\nLifetime: $64.99\\nChoose from two auto-renewing subscriptions or a lifetime subscription to suit your budget. Subscriptions automatically renew at the end of each term and will be charged to your iTunes account unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\\n\\nHEALTH DATA\\nHabitify allows you to create habits and sync your Health data with the app. We do not store any health data on our servers.\\n\\nTerms of Use: https://habitify.me/terms-of-use\\nPrivacy Policy: https://habitify.me/privacy-policy\\n\\nWe at Habitify value your ideas, feedback, and suggestions. Connect with us:\\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/habitify/\\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/UseHabitify\\nEmail: contact@habitify.me\\nCommunity: https://feedback.habitify.me\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":true,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.7.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"# Big News: Checklist for Your Habits\\nBreak down your habit into smaller, actionable tasks and stay on track every step of the way. Whether it’s a morning routine or a creative project, create a mini to-do list within each habit to gain clarity, reduce overwhelm, and celebrate each tiny win!\\n\\n# Smart Icon Searching\\nNo more endless scrolling to find the perfect icon. Simply type in what you’re looking for—using natural language in any language—and our new, smarter search will do the rest.\\n\\n# Journal Badge for Tasks\\nKeep an eye on how many tasks you have left right from your Journal. A small, gamified badge gently nudges you to complete your day and keep up the momentum.\\n\\n# Performance Improvements \u0026 Bug Fixes\\nWe’ve polished things up behind the scenes to make sure your Habitify experience is smoother and more reliable than ever.\\n\\nThank you for using Habitify! Let us know what you think by leaving a review on the App Store. Your feedback keeps us growing.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-15T17:13:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.6.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Large Text mode now shows your habit progress beautifully. Whether you prefer bigger text or smaller, your progress tracking stays clear and readable.\\nSmarter Notes: Your habit notes will now link to the right habits - just as they should. We fixed that mix-up to keep your tracking accurate.\\nPerformance Boost: We've tuned up the engine with faster performance and squashed some bugs. Habitify is all set to power your 2025 resolutions!\\nReady to make 2025 your year of positive change? Update now!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-10T20:07:38Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.6.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Tips \u0026 Tricks: Discover powerful features you might have missed! Our new Tips section helps you get the most out of Habitify.\\nDemo Stats: Understanding your progress just got easier. Explore how the Stats screen works with our interactive demo mode.\\nPlus: Smoother translations across languages, faster performance, and bug fixes to keep your habit tracking seamless.\\nReady to crush your 2025 resolutions? Update Habitify today to kickstart your best year yet!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-03T13:29:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.6.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Notes 2.0: Completely redesigned with a clean, modern interface. Track your emotional journey with new mood tracking - perfect for understanding patterns in your habits and wellbeing.\\nText Size Magic: Habitify now adapts to your device's text size settings. Whether you prefer larger or smaller text, we've got you covered.\\nPlus: Smoother translations, faster app performance, and those pesky bugs? Gone.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-11-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-11-28T08:21:47Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.5.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We've gone all-in on Apple Health integration, because tracking your health shouldn't be harder than actually being healthy!\\n\\nBug Fixes:\\n\\n- Fixed that stubborn promo code redemption issue that was being... not so promotional\\n- Resolved a quirky bug that limited Health connections to 6 months (your habits have no expiration date!)\\n- Fixed habits not showing as complete when synced with Apple Health (yes, you really did finish that workout)\\n\\nNew Health Integration Features:\\nTrack even more aspects of your life with new Apple Health activities support:\\n\\n- Daily Activities:\\nToothbrushing events (because counting to 2 minutes is hard)\\nHandwashing events (your immune system thanks you)\\nApple Stand hours (for those who need a gentle reminder to stop being a statue)\\nSexual activity (keeping things spicy, but private)\\n\\n- Workout Types (because variety is the spice of life):\\nPickleball (tennis's cool younger cousin)\\nSocial dance (two-stepping your way to fitness)\\nCardio dance (when regular cardio needs more rhythm)\\nFitness gaming (making \\\"just one more level\\\" work for you)\\nUnderwater diving (for the merpeople among us)\\nAnd more!\\n\\n- Quantity Tracking:\\nExercise \u0026 movement metrics\\nComprehensive nutrition tracking\\nTime in daylight (for vitamin D enthusiasts)\\nVarious workout measurements\\n\\nWe've also added support for monitoring your dietary habits, from cholesterol to zinc, because we know you're more than just your step count.\\nThanks for sticking with us and making Habitify part of your daily routine. Stay tuned for more updates – we're just getting warmed up!\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-11-11\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-11-11T09:01:52Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.5.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We've gone all-in on Apple Health integration, because tracking your health shouldn't be harder than actually being healthy!\\n\\nBug Fixes:\\n\\n- Fixed that stubborn promo code redemption issue that was being... not so promotional\\n- Resolved a quirky bug that limited Health connections to 6 months (your habits have no expiration date!)\\n- Fixed habits not showing as complete when synced with Apple Health (yes, you really did finish that workout)\\n\\nNew Health Integration Features:\\nTrack even more aspects of your life with new Apple Health activities support:\\n\\n- Daily Activities:\\nToothbrushing events (because counting to 2 minutes is hard)\\nHandwashing events (your immune system thanks you)\\nApple Stand hours (for those who need a gentle reminder to stop being a statue)\\nSexual activity (keeping things spicy, but private)\\n\\n- Workout Types (because variety is the spice of life):\\nPickleball (tennis's cool younger cousin)\\nSocial dance (two-stepping your way to fitness)\\nCardio dance (when regular cardio needs more rhythm)\\nFitness gaming (making \\\"just one more level\\\" work for you)\\nUnderwater diving (for the merpeople among us)\\nAnd more!\\n\\n- Quantity Tracking:\\nExercise \u0026 movement metrics\\nComprehensive nutrition tracking\\nTime in daylight (for vitamin D enthusiasts)\\nVarious workout measurements\\n\\nWe've also added support for monitoring your dietary habits, from cholesterol to zinc, because we know you're more than just your step count.\\nThanks for sticking with us and making Habitify part of your daily routine. Stay tuned for more updates – we're just getting warmed up!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-11-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-11-05T21:22:27Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.5.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Holy icons, Batman!\\nOur icon library just went through a serious growth spurt - now featuring 700+ shiny new icons! From meditation to mountain climbing, your habits can finally express their true personality. (Yes, even that weird habit of talking to your plants)\\n\\nLightning Fast\\nWe've turbocharged Habitify's performance faster than your morning coffee kicks in. Smoother than a freshly buttered slide!\\n\\nNever Miss a Beat\\nNotifications are now more reliable than your friend who always returns borrowed books. Whether you're tracking 5 habits or 500 (you overachiever, you!), we've got your back.\\n\\nAs always, we love hearing from you! Drop us a review if you're enjoying Habitify - it makes our developers do their happy dance\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-11-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-11-01T20:14:55Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.4.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- iOS 18 Support: We're fully compatible with iOS 18 now! Your habits are so future-proof, they're practically time travelers.\\n- Dark Mode Icons: New icon options for dark mode and tinted versions. Because even your app icon deserves a stylish nighttime outfit.\\n\\nStay tuned for more amazing features next month! We're cooking up something so good, it might just become your new habit to check for updates.\\nRemember, building good habits is a journey. We're just here to make sure you look good while you're on it!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-18T06:48:35Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.4.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- iOS 18 Support: We're fully compatible with iOS 18 now! Your habits are so future-proof, they're practically time travelers.\\n- Dark Mode Icons: New icon options for dark mode and tinted versions. Because even your app icon deserves a stylish nighttime outfit.\\n\\n\\nStay tuned for more amazing features next month! We're cooking up something so good, it might just become your new habit to check for updates.\\nRemember, building good habits is a journey. We're just here to make sure you look good while you're on it!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-16T10:40:59Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.3.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Auto Skip/Fail: Set it and forget it! Habitify now automatically marks your habits as skipped or failed when the day ends. No more manual checks—let us handle it for you!\\n- Stability improvements to keep Habitify running smoothly.\\n- Bug fixes: We’ve ironed out some pesky issues.\\n\\n\\nExciting updates are on the horizon—stay tuned!\\nThanks for being a part of the Habitify journey. Happy habit tracking!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-08-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-08-15T21:29:10Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.2.10\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Confetti Celebration: Now, when you complete your last habit of the day, you’ll get a burst of confetti to celebrate your awesomeness. Keep those habits going and enjoy your daily mini party!\\n- New Languages Added: We’re expanding our linguistic horizons! Habitify now speaks Indonesian and Greek. Say hello to new friends and keep building habits no matter where you are in the world. Selamat datang! Καλώς ήρθατε!\\n- Bugs Begone: We’ve squashed some bugs and made performance improvements to keep Habitify running smoother than ever. Your habit-tracking experience just got a serious upgrade.\\n\\nUpdate now and keep rocking those habits!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-28T09:50:11Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.2.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Customize Time of Day from Journal: Now you can tweak your routines directly from your Journal. Because who doesn’t love a good shortcut?\\n- Tips for New Users: We’ve added some handy tips to help you discover all the hidden gems in Habitify. Consider it your treasure map to habit success!\\n- Spanish Translation: ¡Hola! Our Spanish translation has leveled up. Now it’s más bueno que nunca!\\n- Bug Fixes \u0026 Performance Boosts: We squashed some bugs and gave the app a little tune-up. It’s smoother, faster, and ready to help you crush those habits!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-17T15:17:41Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.2.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Bug Fixes: We've squashed several pesky bugs to enhance your experience and ensure smoother app functionality.\\n- Dark Mode Enhancement: Improved accessibility in dark mode for a more comfortable viewing experience in low-light conditions.\\n- Performance Enhancements: Enjoy faster and more reliable app performance with our latest optimizations.\\n\\nThank you for using Habitify! As always, we appreciate your feedback and are constantly working to improve your experience. If you enjoy our app, consider leaving us a review.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-09T06:44:28Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.2.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Bug Fixes: We've squashed several pesky bugs to enhance your experience and ensure smoother app functionality.\\n- Dark Mode Enhancement: Improved accessibility in dark mode for a more comfortable viewing experience in low-light conditions.\\n- Performance Enhancements: Enjoy faster and more reliable app performance with our latest optimizations.\\n\\nThank you for using Habitify! As always, we appreciate your feedback and are constantly working to improve your experience. If you enjoy our app, consider leaving us a review.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-08T06:27:08Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.2.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Bug Fixes: We've squashed several pesky bugs to enhance your experience and ensure smoother app functionality.\\n- Dark Mode Enhancement: Improved accessibility in dark mode for a more comfortable viewing experience in low-light conditions.\\n- Performance Enhancements: Enjoy faster and more reliable app performance with our latest optimizations.\\n\\nThank you for using Habitify! As always, we appreciate your feedback and are constantly working to improve your experience. If you enjoy our app, consider leaving us a review.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-07T17:22:52Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.2.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Refined Sleep Tracking: We've fine-tuned our sleep tracking! Now, focus solely on the time you're actually asleep, giving you more accurate insights into your restful hours.\\n- Smarter Progress Tracking: Your progress page now remembers your last selected range. Exit the app and return to find your preferred view waiting for you – it’s all about personalizing your habit journey.\\n- Enhancements \u0026 Fixes: We've squashed some minor bugs and made a few tweaks to ensure your Habitify experience is smoother and more reliable than ever.\\n\\nAs you journey through 2024, let Habitify be your companion in nurturing positive habits and reaching new milestones. Thank you for choosing us. Here’s to a year of growth, restful nights, and meaningful progress!\\n\\nHappy Habit Building in 2024!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-19\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-19T10:16:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.2.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Supercharge Your 2024 Resolutions!\\n\\n- Enhanced Timer Stability: Our timer now runs more smoothly than ever, even in the background. Keep track of your habits seamlessly, anytime, anywhere.\\n- Calendar Sync Perfected: Say goodbye to sync issues! Our calendar function now works flawlessly, making it easier to align your habits with your schedule.\\n- Overall Performance Boost: We've turbocharged the app's performance and stability, ensuring a smoother, more reliable experience as you build and track your habits.\\n\\n\\n\\nReady to conquer your 2024 resolutions? With these updates, Habitify is not just an app; it’s your companion in transforming aspirations into reality. \\nLet's make this year the year of remarkable habits!\\n\\nThank you for being part of the Habitify family. Happy habit tracking!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-18T11:57:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.2.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Enhanced Notes Experience: We've smoothed out the UI on iOS 17, making your note-taking seamless and more intuitive.\\n- Apple Watch Sync Perfected: Now, when you open the app on your Apple Watch, data reloads instantly - keeping your tracking accurate and up-to-date.\\n- Boosted Stability and Performance: We've made overall improvements for a smoother, more reliable habit tracking journey.\\n\\nKeep building those positive habits – your journey to greatness just got better!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-29T15:10:29Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Bug Fixes: We've ironed out the kinks for a smoother journey.\\n- Performance: Faster and more reliable, just like your best habits!\\nRemember, every small improvement counts, both in-app and in life. Here's to building better habits together!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-30T16:27:52Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.2.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Bug Fixes: We've ironed out the kinks for a smoother journey.\\n- Performance: Faster and more reliable, just like your best habits!\\nRemember, every small improvement counts, both in-app and in life. Here's to building better habits together!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-25T12:24:52Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.1.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Interactive Widgets: Log your habit data effortlessly—right from your home screen.\\n- Onboarding Tips: We've added helpful guidance for newcomers to maximize their Habitify experience.\\n- iOS 17 Compatibility: Enjoy enhanced performance and stability, fully optimized for iOS 17.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-16T14:38:38Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.1.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Interactive Widgets: Log your habit data effortlessly—right from your home screen.\\n- Onboarding Tips: We've added helpful guidance for newcomers to maximize their Habitify experience.\\n- iOS 17 Compatibility: Enjoy enhanced performance and stability, fully optimized for iOS 17.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-13T18:08:21Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Minor bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-08-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-08-09T01:15:59Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Revamped Progress Screen: We've redesigned our progress screen to make it more engaging. Now, you can view the progress of all your habits over time in one place! No need to tap into each habit individually. It's a bird's eye view of your growth journey!\\n\\nOptional Mood Section: We understand that not everyone tracks their mood daily. So, we've made the Mood section optional. If you don't have any mood data, it won't show up. This will make your interface cleaner and more focused on what matters to you.\\n\\nWe've been working hard to make these improvements, and we're thrilled to finally be able to share them with you. As always, we appreciate your patience and support as we continually strive to make Habitify a better tool for your habit-building journey.\\n\\nThank you for being part of our community. We wish you an even more motivated and successful habit building journey with Habitify!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-27\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-07-27T14:55:10Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"13.0.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Resolved an issue preventing full synchronization of habits on watchOS 9 devices.\\n- Enhanced habit creation with the addition of an area selection feature.\\n- Extended the selectable Repeat Interval to a maximum of 30 days.\\n- The feature to select a Cover Challenge from Unsplash has been fixed and is now fully operational.\\n- Multiple bugs have been addressed and overall app performance has been enhanced.\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-06\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-05-06T02:50:08Z\"}],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://habitify.me/\",\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"editorialNotes\":{\"short\":\"Focus on the next tasks\",\"tagline\":\"Stay on track with your goals\"},\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1111447047\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=871441201\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":201543680}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1111447047\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=871441201\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":201543680}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2016-09-02\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"co.vuvo.habitify\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/e6/21/bc/e621bce1-ea35-508c-12e5-2272b788edc7/AppIcon-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-0-85-220-0.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor1\":\"00193e\",\"textColor2\":\"102d62\",\"textColor3\":\"334765\",\"textColor4\":\"3f5781\"},\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://habitify.me/privacy-policy\",\"videoPreviewsByType\":{},\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://habitify.me/\",\"