":\"/v1/catalog/us/developers/883550351?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"genreNames\":[],\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"name\":\"Unstatic Ltd Co\",\"mediaType\":\"Mobile Software Applications\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/unstatic-ltd-co/id883550351\"}}]},\"genres\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1111447047/genres?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"6007\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/genres/6007?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"name\":\"Productivity\",\"parentId\":\"36\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id6007\"}},{\"id\":\"6013\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/genres/6013?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"name\":\"Health \u0026 Fitness\",\"parentId\":\"36\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id6013\"}}]}},\"meta\":{\"contentVersion\":{\"MZ_INDEXER\":1736961938309,\"RTCI\":1736962515326}}},{\"id\":\"1609960918\",\"type\":\"apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1609960918?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"distributionKind\":\"APP_STORE\",\"supportsArcade\":false,\"isFirstPartyHideableApp\":false,\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"privacyType\":\"Data Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected and linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Purchases\",\"identifier\":\"PURCHASES\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Contact Info\",\"identifier\":\"CONTACT_INFO\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"User Content\",\"identifier\":\"USER_CONTENT\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]},{\"privacyType\":\"Data Not Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"4+\",\"value\":100,\"rank\":1}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"mac\",\"iphone\"],\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":true,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/jomo-screen-time-blocker/id1609960918\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4.8,\"ratingCount\":898,\"ratingCountList\":[25,10,15,37,811],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.8 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0.0\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Productivity\",\"name\":\"Jomo - Screen Time Blocker\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"artistName\":\"Jomo\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 16.0 or later.\"},\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires macOS 13.0 or later.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires visionOS 1.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"osx\":{\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Struggling with distractions on your Mac? With so many websites and apps providing endless entertainment just a click away, it can be challenging to stay on track.\\n\\nJomo helps you keep your focus and screen time in check day after day. It allows you to block distracting apps and websites in just a few clicks and to use them on a timer, helping you focus better and make the most out of your days.\\n\\nSo, are you ready for a better screen time and focus? Download Jomo and let's get started!\\n\\n\\n** TOP 15 APPS CREATED BY WOMEN 2023 - APPLE APP STORE **\\n\\n\\n◆ BENEFITS ◆\\n\\n- Increased Focus: Work better by reducing distractions and multitasking. Experience an instant improvement in your productivity and the quality of your work.\\n- Digital Minimalism: Align your Mac usage with your intentions. Set up long-term procedures that will help you block impulse opens and encourage a more balanced use of your Mac.\\n- Better Sleep: End mindless scrolling and binge-watching at bedtime. Get enough sleep and wake up feeling refreshed.\\n- Healthy Habits: Organize your days and align your actions with your goals. Say good-bye to procrastination.\\n- Save Money: Avoid impulsive purchases and excessive exposure to social media ads.\\n- Break Addictions: Block websites related to porn, gambling, and more.\\n\\n◆ FEATURES ◆\\n\\n- Website Blocker: Block any website on the following browsers: Safari, Google Chrome, Arc, Opera, Microsoft Edge, and Brave Browser.\\n- App Blocker: Block any app on your Mac (e.g., Mail, Slack).\\n- Breaks: Take short, intentional breaks from blocking. Prevent mindless scrolling by using distracting websites and apps on a timer.\\n- Schedules: Schedule recurring blocking sessions, such as Monday to Friday during your work hours.\\n- Easy to set up: Start blocking apps and websites in just a few clicks. Using our templates, you can easily build a focus system that meets your specific needs.\\n- Secure: Jomo blocks apps and websites requiring minimal permissions. It is safe, precise, and doesn't slow down your Mac.\\n\\n◆ JOMO PLUS ◆\\n\\n**SAVE 2+ HOURS EVERY DAY AND REGAIN YOUR ABILITY TO FOCUS FOR THE PRICE OF A COFFEE**\\n\\nIncluded in Jomo Plus:\\n- Unlimited Recurring Sessions: Add multiple recurring sessions.\\n- Strict Mode:  You can configure Jomo for Mac to be much harder to bypass.\\n- The subscription also includes the iPhone and iPad version!\\n\\nJomo offers auto-renewable subscriptions:\\n\\n- $5.99/month (automatically renewed)\\n- $2.49/month (billed annually via a $29.99 payment)\\n- $99.99 (one-time purchase)\\n\\nThe yearly plan includes a 3-day free trial.\\n\\nAfter the free trial (only available on the annual version), the total amount for the subscription will be charged to your iTunes Account. The subscription automatically renews unless it is canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Your account will be charged for renewal at the total subscription price within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. Subscriptions and auto-renewals may be managed or canceled via your iTunes Account Settings.\\n\\nThese prices are in US Dollars (USD). Pricing in other currencies and countries may vary and actual charges may be converted to your local currency depending on the country of residence.\\n\\n◆ PRIVACY ◆\\n\\nIf you want to learn more about our terms and privacy policy:\\n\\n- Terms of Use: https://getjomo.notion.site/Terms-of-Use-fb74fe39233b468f937707aeb2020bc2\\n- Privacy Policy: https://getjomo.notion.site/Privacy-Policy-7265a825c9fe4b289229cec614a169fd\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"◆ NEW STRICT MODE “ON TIME RANGE” ◆\\n\\nIn this update, we’ve introduced the option to apply Strict Mode to a rule within the interval of your choice. For example, you can prevent yourself from editing a rule two hours before it starts. We’ve also redesigned the Strict Mode configuration screen to make it more intuitive. We hope you enjoy it!\u2028\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* Jomo Mac is now compatible with Firefox! A pop-up will appear the next time you open Firefox. Follow the setup steps (copying a file and installing our Firefox extension) to enable website blocking on Firefox. This feature is still in beta—we can’t wait to hear your feedback.\\n* We’ve made a lot of small UI/UX improvements to the app based on your feedback!\\n* The “Reset blocking” troubleshooting option should work again on macOS Sequoia 15.1.\\n* We’ve resolved a few crashes that some of you might have experienced. This version of the app should provide greater stability.  \\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you love about it. :)\\n\\nSee you soon,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-05T11:15:33Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* You can now start blocking sessions directly from the menu bar for faster access.\\n* We’ve made it easier to switch languages within the app—just head to Settings \u003e Language.\\n* The main window can now be assigned across all desktops. Simply select the “Assign to all desktops” option in the menu bar.\\n* Fixed a bug that prevented linking an app group (with only keywords) to a blocking rule. Big thanks to Walter for reporting this!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-10-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-10-20T07:08:08Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"◆ HUGE UPDATE TO THE JOMO MAC APP  ◆\\n\\nWe hope you had a great summer! Between two ocean dips, we’ve been hard at work improving the Jomo Mac app after months of focusing on the iOS app. To make up for the wait, this update is packed with improvements—let’s dive in.\\n\\n◆ MORE POWERFUL WEBSITE BLOCKING  ◆\\n\\nWe’ve completely upgraded our website blocking system:\\n\\n* You can now block full URLs, not just domains, and use wildcards (!). This means you can block specific pages like “reddit.com/r/soccer” or use patterns like “google.com/*q=*news*” to block all Google searches containing \\\"news.\\\" Thanks to everyone who shared their use cases, helping us develop the right solution. \\n* New website categories available: Social Media, Streaming, News, etc.\\n* Import/export websites and exceptions with a .txt file.\\n\\n◆ NEW BREAKS AND STRICT MODE OPTIONS FOR SESSION RULES ◆\\n\\nYou can now access the same breaks and strict mode options on the Mac as on the Jomo iOS app.\\n\\n◆ INTEGRATION WITH SHORTCUTS AND FOCUS FILTERS ◆\\n\\nYou can now start and stop a Jomo session with Mac shortcuts. A Jomo session can also start when a focus mode is enabled.\\n\\n◆ OTHER IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* Added support for Opera GX and Orion RC.\\n* App blocking is now much faster.\\n* Jomo Mac can now block Steam.\\n* Fixed an issue where new tabs were blocked in Chrome and Safari when all websites were blocked with Jomo.\\n* The window is now resizable, and the font size is slightly larger for better readability.\\n* Fix multiple crashes affecting Intel-based Macs.\\n* The app now launches correctly after a restart on macOS Sequoia.\\n* Add customization options for block screens: light/dark mode, types of block screens to display.\\n* Fix an issue where app and website selection screens occasionally do not display correctly.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-10-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-10-05T17:23:48Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"◆ HUGE UPDATE TO THE JOMO MAC APP  ◆\\n\\nWe hope you had a great summer! Between two ocean dips, we’ve been hard at work improving the Jomo Mac app after months of focusing on the iOS app. To make up for the wait, this update is packed with improvements—let’s dive in.\\n\\n◆ MORE POWERFUL WEBSITE BLOCKING  ◆\\n\\nWe’ve completely upgraded our website blocking system:\\n\\n* You can now block full URLs, not just domains, and use wildcards (!). This means you can block specific pages like “reddit.com/r/soccer” or use patterns like “google.com/*q=*news*” to block all Google searches containing \\\"news.\\\" Thanks to everyone who shared their use cases, helping us develop the right solution. \\n* New website categories available: Social Media, Streaming, News, etc.\\n* Import/export websites and exceptions with a .txt file.\\n\\n◆ NEW BREAKS AND STRICT MODE OPTIONS FOR SESSION RULES ◆\\n\\nYou can now access the same breaks and strict mode options on the Mac as on the Jomo iOS app.\\n\\n◆ INTEGRATION WITH SHORTCUTS AND FOCUS FILTERS ◆\\n\\nYou can now start and stop a Jomo session with Mac shortcuts. A Jomo session can also start when a focus mode is enabled.\\n\\n◆ OTHER IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* Added support for Opera GX and Orion RC.\\n* App blocking is now much faster.\\n* Jomo Mac can now block Steam.\\n* Fixed an issue where new tabs were blocked in Chrome and Safari when all websites were blocked with Jomo.\\n* The window is now resizable, and the font size is slightly larger for better readability.\\n* Fix multiple crashes affecting Intel-based Macs.\\n* The app now launches correctly after a restart on macOS Sequoia.\\n* Add customization options for block screens: light/dark mode, types of block screens to display.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-10-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-10-02T12:36:11Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"◆ HUGE UPDATE TO THE JOMO MAC APP  ◆\\n\\nWe hope you had a great summer! Between two ocean dips, we’ve been hard at work improving the Jomo Mac app after months of focusing on the iOS app. To make up for the wait, this update is packed with improvements—let’s dive in.\\n\\n◆ MORE POWERFUL WEBSITE BLOCKING  ◆\\n\\nWe’ve completely upgraded our website blocking system:\\n\\n* You can now block full URLs, not just domains, and use wildcards (!). This means you can block specific pages like “reddit.com/r/soccer” or use patterns like “google.com/*q=*news*” to block all Google searches containing \\\"news.\\\" Thanks to everyone who shared their use cases, helping us develop the right solution. \\n* New website categories available: Social Media, Streaming, News, etc.\\n* Import/export websites and exceptions with a .txt file.\\n\\n◆ NEW BREAKS AND STRICT MODE OPTIONS FOR SESSION RULES ◆\\n\\nYou can now access the same breaks and strict mode options on the Mac as on the Jomo iOS app.\\n\\n◆ INTEGRATION WITH SHORTCUTS AND FOCUS FILTERS ◆\\n\\nYou can now start and stop a Jomo session with Mac shortcuts. A Jomo session can also start when a focus mode is enabled.\\n\\n◆ OTHER IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* Added support for Opera GX and Orion RC.\\n* App blocking is now much faster.\\n* Jomo Mac can now block Steam.\\n* Fixed an issue where new tabs were blocked in Chrome and Safari when all websites were blocked with Jomo.\\n* The window is now resizable, and the font size is slightly larger for better readability.\\n* Fix multiple crashes affecting Intel-based Macs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-23T14:19:15Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"◆ HUGE UPDATE TO THE JOMO MAC APP  ◆\\n\\nWe hope you had a great summer! Between two ocean dips, we’ve been hard at work improving the Jomo Mac app after months of focusing on the iOS app. To make up for the wait, this update is packed with improvements—let’s dive in.\\n\\n◆ MORE POWERFUL WEBSITE BLOCKING  ◆\\n\\nWe’ve completely upgraded our website blocking system:\\n\\n* You can now block full URLs, not just domains, and use wildcards (!). This means you can block specific pages like “reddit.com/r/soccer” or use patterns like “google.com/*q=*news*” to block all Google searches containing \\\"news.\\\" Thanks to everyone who shared their use cases, helping us develop the right solution. \\n* New website categories available: Social Media, Streaming, News, etc.\\n* Import/export websites and exceptions with a .txt file.\\n\\n◆ NEW BREAKS AND STRICT MODE OPTIONS FOR SESSION RULES ◆\\n\\nYou can now access the same breaks and strict mode options on the Mac as on the Jomo iOS app.\\n\\n◆ INTEGRATION WITH SHORTCUTS AND FOCUS FILTERS ◆\\n\\nYou can now start and stop a Jomo session with Mac shortcuts. A Jomo session can also start when a focus mode is enabled.\\n\\n◆ OTHER IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* Added support for Opera GX and Orion RC.\\n* App blocking is now much faster.\\n* Jomo Mac can now block Steam.\\n* Fixed an issue where new tabs were blocked in Chrome and Safari when all websites were blocked with Jomo.\\n* The window is now resizable, and the font size is slightly larger for better readability.\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-12T08:06:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ SESSION TEMPLATES AND APP GROUPS ◆\\n\\nIn this new version, we've added not one, but two of your most requested features for Jomo Mac:\\n* You can now create and edit session templates on Jomo Mac. This allows you to fine-tune sessions to your liking and reuse them anytime, saving you a lot of time!\\n* Finally, we've added app groups to Jomo Mac. With app groups, you can define reusable lists of apps and websites to block. These lists can then be easily reused in your blocking sessions, allowing you to create groups for fun apps, work apps, etc.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have added support for Orion.\u2028\\n* We have improved the “All except…” mode for apps, ensuring it doesn’t block any important system apps (thanks to Andy for the feedback).\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo Mac? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-07T09:16:18Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ JOMO MAC NOW SUPPORTS WHITELISTS AND ADULT CONTENT ◆\\n\\nYou can now use Jomo on Mac to block all apps and websites except those you specify. Additionally, you can block categories of websites, starting with adult content. These were among the top requested features since we released the first version of Jomo for Mac. We hope you will appreciate this update.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have added support for the Vivaldi browser (thanks to Gianni and Mohamed for your feedback).\\n* We have added a way to define exceptions to your website's blocklist. For example, you can block “youtube.com” but define an exception for “music.youtube.com” (thanks to Hyunni for the suggestion).\\n* We have fixed a bug which caused the profile not to sync automatically (thanks to Jaga for reporting it).\\n* We have made a range of optimizations to ensure Jomo runs smoothly on your Mac.\\n* We have fixed an issue that prevented users from updating the app when a blocking rule was active.\\n* We have fixed a bug where multiple sessions with whitelists were not merging correctly (special thanks to Rayan for reporting this).\u2028\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo Mac? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-23T08:29:24Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-15T08:33:34Z\"}],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://jomo.so/\",\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1609960918\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=870781412\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":19268336}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1609960918\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=870781412\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":19268336}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2022-10-16\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"com.jomo.Jomo\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/24/08/b2/2408b282-b2d4-41cd-ec70-156444211e09/AppIcon-0-0-85-220-0-0-5-0-2x.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"5298ff\",\"textColor1\":\"000000\",\"textColor2\":\"161616\",\"textColor3\":\"101e33\",\"textColor4\":\"223045\"},\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://getjomo.notion.site/Privacy-Policy-7265a825c9fe4b289229cec614a169fd\",\"videoPreviewsByType\":{},\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://help.jomo.so/en/\",\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":false,\"runsOnAppleSilicon\":true,\"requiresRosetta\":false,\"editorialArtwork\":{\"contentIconTrimmedMonochrome\":{\"width\":1048,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/6e/e2/e7/6ee2e7db-bf98-0d30-7adf-15aa80debeb5/721e011e-109f-4227-8978-1f8c6071c48f.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\"},\"contentIconTrimmed\":{\"width\":1048,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/09/15/89/091589bc-f33b-2d71-9e77-2ef3729cd955/abc2adb6-5a59-47b0-b8f5-84523bdd6bd8.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"0092ff\",\"textColor1\":\"00070c\",\"textColor2\":\"000e19\",\"textColor3\":\"00233d\",\"textColor4\":\"002947\"},\"brandLogo\":{\"width\":1080,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/1c/2b/7c/1c2b7cc6-e029-9bf9-f26f-4b5f533ee2fc/af8e3a5e-dba7-4ad7-9b94-9340366eab93.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\"}},\"subtitle\":\"Self Control \u0026 Focus\",\"preflightPackageUrl\":\"https://osxapps.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Purple211/v4/2a/74/ae/2a74ae6c-fd1f-40dc-19ab-bf44e9684c15/fqn9321263802377958859.pfpkg\",\"customAttributes\":{\"default\":{\"default\":{\"customVideoPreviewsByType\":{},\"customScreenshotsByType\":{\"mac\":[{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/c8/dd/7f/c8dd7f2d-7014-160c-411b-a64f91324552/940608cc-7161-49b6-ad4e-3ba6d689371d_MAC_EN_1.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"569afd\",\"textColor1\":\"000000\",\"textColor2\":\"162130\",\"textColor3\":\"111e32\",\"textColor4\":\"233959\"},{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/8e/ab/df/8eabdfe7-99e9-64e5-b862-306472f7aa46/c1c15428-491e-474a-a29e-f8839581a421_MAC_EN_2.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"569aff\",\"textColor1\":\"000000\",\"textColor2\":\"0e1b2e\",\"textColor3\":\"111e33\",\"textColor4\":\"1c3458\"},{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/a2/e7/85/a2e785be-c268-abd1-5fa8-2fa6dd225e07/7509e8a9-7e6c-4ee4-9cbb-01ef7ec6cd6f_MAC_EN_3.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"5498fb\",\"textColor1\":\"000000\",\"textColor2\":\"1a1d22\",\"textColor3\":\"101e32\",\"textColor4\":\"25364d\"},{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/3b/02/aa/3b02aaaa-ad35-de97-ffa6-73b418177769/c49e919d-5e7b-4c99-96b0-34378680d95c_MAC_EN_4.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"5597f8\",\"textColor1\":\"000000\",\"textColor2\":\"1f1f1f\",\"textColor3\":\"111e31\",\"textColor4\":\"29374a\"},{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/c9/b8/bd/c9b8bdb3-73cf-1381-a730-bb2d3890153c/2026f25c-eb71-4f65-80a6-3b2840697f37_MAC_EN_5.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"5696fb\",\"textColor1\":\"000000\",\"textColor2\":\"261c12\",\"textColor3\":\"111e32\",\"textColor4\":\"303540\"},{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/9c/5c/d5/9c5cd590-db88-0863-d350-ac6c764ce0c3/06f4c4ed-cccb-40e9-9c22-03bbcf32ef23_MAC_EN_6.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\"}]}}}},\"runsOnIntel\":true},\"ios\":{\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Welcome to Jomo, an app that helps you stop wasting time on your phone so you can thrive every day!\\n\\nWe make reducing screen time super easy and fun.\\n\\nUnsure of how to improve your screen time? We got you! Jomo will help you understand the time spent on your phone and how to find a healthy balance between productivity and play. Will you be #productive or #distracted? Come and find out!\\n\\nJomo offers a powerful app-blocking system that will change how you use your phone in the long term. Block one or more apps for the times you set to focus on what matters most. You can always take mindful breaks if you need to.\\n\\nSo, ready to feel proud about your screen time? Download Jomo and let's get started!\\n\\n◆ BENEFITS ◆\\n\\n1. Sleep Better: Stop mindless scrolling at bedtime\\n2. Stay Focused: Work better by reducing distractions and multitasking\\n3. Save Time: Reduce your screen time by 50% in the first week\\n4. Healthy Habits: Protect special moments with your screen time routine\\n5. Save Money: Prevent impulsive buying and being overexposed to social media ads\\n6. Break Addictions: Block adult content, gambling websites, and more\\n\\n◆ BLOCK ANY APP AND WEBSITE ON YOUR IPHONE/IPAD ◆\\n\\nYou can use Jomo to block any app as well as websites (on all browsers). You can also select entire categories of apps and websites to block (Social Media, Games, Shopping, etc). It's time to protect your time and attention from these distractions:\\n\\n- Instagram\\n- TikTok\\n- Facebook\\n- Twitter/X\\n- LinkedIn\\n- Youtube\\n- Snapchat\\n- Netflix\\n- Tinder\\n- And more: Messaging (WhatsApp, Messenger), News, Dating, Adult/Porn, Money/Gambling apps, etc.\\n\\n◆ PRIVACY ◆\\n\\nTo access your screen time and block apps, Jomo uses the secured Screen Time API provided by Apple. Jomo has no access and will never see your private data (used apps, passwords, messages, content viewed, etc.).\\n\\nIf you want to learn more about our terms and privacy policy:\\n\\n- Terms of Use: https://getjomo.notion.site/Terms-of-Use-fb74fe39233b468f937707aeb2020bc2\\n- Privacy Policy: https://getjomo.notion.site/Privacy-Policy-7265a825c9fe4b289229cec614a169fd\\n\\n◆ JOMO PLUS ◆\\n\\nJomo offers auto-renewable subscriptions:\\n\\n- $5.99/month (automatically renewed)\\n- $2.49/month (billed annually via a $29.99 payment)\\n- $99.99 (one-time purchase)\\n\\nThe yearly plan includes a 3-day free trial.\\n\\nAfter the free trial (only available on the annual version), the total amount for the subscription will be charged to your iTunes Account. The subscription automatically renews unless it is canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Your account will be charged for renewal at the total subscription price within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. Subscriptions and auto-renewals may be managed or canceled via your iTunes Account Settings.\\n\\nThese prices are in US Dollars (USD). Pricing in other currencies and countries may vary and actual charges may be converted to your local currency depending on the country of residence.\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.25\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We’ve streamlined the design of our block screens.\\n\\n◆ BUG FIXES ◆\\n\\n* The weekly average screen time displayed in our widget was incorrect.\\n* Reminders for a screen time limit rule were sent, even when the rule was supposed to be inactive.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you love about it. :)\\n\\nSee you soon,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-12T13:52:01Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.24\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n\u2028\u2028Happy holidays to you all! It’s time to enjoy our loved ones and put our screens down for a bit. See you in 2025 with plenty of exciting new things for Jomo—we can’t wait to share them with you.\\n\\n\u2028◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* Fixed an issue where breaks triggered by a shortcut weren't counted correctly. Many thanks to Joel for reporting it.  \\n* Improved the UI/UX to make your Jomo experience even better.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you love about it. :)\\n\\nSee you soon,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-28T14:01:39Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.23\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n\u2028◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We’ve fixed a major issue for new users on iOS 18 that prevented block screens from displaying correctly. Thank you to everyone who reported this!\\n* App groups can now be duplicated for easier reuse. Simply long-press an app group and select “Duplicate.\\\"\\n* We’ve removed some low-level Apple activities from the screen time reports in the Home and Profile tabs.\\n* Some toggles were unresponsive to tap events for iOS 18.2 users. This issue has been resolved.\\n* We’ve made several UI/UX improvements to enhance your Jomo experience.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you love about it. :)\\n\\nSee you soon,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\u2028\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-04T18:03:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.22\",\"releaseNotes\":\"◆ NEW STRICT MODE “ON TIME RANGE” ◆\\n\\nIn this update, we’ve introduced the option to apply Strict Mode to a rule within the interval of your choice. For example, you can prevent yourself from editing a rule two hours before it starts. We’ve also redesigned the Strict Mode configuration screen to make it more intuitive. We hope you enjoy it!\u2028\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We’ve made a lot of small UI/UX improvements to the app based on your feedback!\\n* We’ve added an “Unpause Rule” shortcut. Thanks to Šimon for the initial suggestion.  \\n* We’ve fixed a few shortcuts: “Get Strict Mode Status” should now work reliably, and “Count App Open” should no longer return an error when your limit is not active.  \\n* In some cases, live activities were not triggered when starting a quick blocking session. This is now fixed. Many thanks to Ruben for helping us troubleshoot this long-standing issue!\\n* The “Apple Journal” icon now appears by default in the screen time reports.  \\n* We’ve resolved a few crashes that some of you might have experienced. This version of the app should provide greater stability.  \\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you love about it. :)\\n\\nSee you soon,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-11-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-11-20T08:56:34Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.21\",\"releaseNotes\":\"◆ UNLOCK YOUR APPS WITH A QR CODE OR NFC TAG ◆\\n\\nHey everyone! With this update, distracting apps and websites can remain blocked until you scan a physical key, such as a QR code or NFC tag.\\n\\nLeave this key at home, the office, the gym, or even grandma’s house—just like the distractions! Your phone stays in zero-distraction mode until you return to this object. Now, you can keep work at work or leave Instagram behind, for good.\\n\\nTwo ways to use the “QR Code” or “NFC Tag” feature on Jomo:\\n* New Action Rule: Use your QR code or NFC tag as a key to unlock your apps (Rules \u003e + \u003e Action \u003e Scan First). It’s simple: link your key to a rule and lock your apps. To access them, you’ll need to scan the key!\\n* New Break Type: Use a QR code or NFC tag as a key to temporarily unlock your apps (Breaks \u003e Friction \u003e QR Code / NFC Tag).\\n\\nMany of you were waiting for this: it’s here! We’ve taken the time to get it right, and we can’t wait to hear your feedback.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* Were the block screens too bright for you? Fixed! They now come in dark mode.\\n* Is Jomo speaking to you in the wrong language? Change it! Go to Profile \u003e Settings \u003e Language and pick the right one.\\n* Was navigating through Actions \u0026 Limits too complicated? We’ve simplified it to make it more user-friendly.\\n* Was the “Random Code” exercise too easy? No problem. We’ve added an “Automatic” mode. With this new mode, the text gets longer after each pause or based on the length of the pause (your choice).\\n* The design of the Squads cards has been revamped to match the rest of the app.\\n* We’ve added the option to set a minimum time between openings for an “App Opens Limit”. In the Shortcuts app, expand all options for the action “Count App Open For Limit Named…”. You can now set the delay via the “Minimum Time Between Opens (Seconds)” property.\\n* And we’ve made tons of small improvements to make your Jomo experience even better!\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you love about it. :)\\n\\nSee you soon,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-10-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-10-21T08:56:33Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.20\",\"releaseNotes\":\"◆ JOMO IS READY FOR IOS 18  ◆\\n\\nJomo is releasing new features alongside the new iOS update:\\n\\n* You can now block apps until you log your mood in the Health app (also called State of Mind). Go to Rules \u003e + \u003e Action \u003e Log your mood to try it out!\\n* The app icon now adapts to both dark and tinted modes on the home screen, available with iOS 18.\\n* Widgets have been updated to support the new tinted mode on the home screen.\\n* Start or end a blocking session directly from the Control Center. Create a shortcut using the \\\"Start Session\\\" or \\\"Stop Session\\\" actions provided by Jomo in the Shortcuts app, then access it through the Shortcuts control in your Control Center.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* Collapsed sections in the Rules tab now stay collapsed after restarting the app.\\n* We prevented a bypass on the adult whitelist screen. Many thanks to Steven for the bug report!\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-16T14:44:46Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.19\",\"releaseNotes\":\"**IF YOU’VE SET UP SHORTCUTS AND AUTOMATIONS USING JOMO**\\n\\nWe’ve improved our shortcut actions to be more versatile and powerful. Some actions might need resetting, so double-check any shortcuts and automations that rely on Jomo.\\n\\n◆ JOMO IS BACK FOR THE NEW SEASON  ◆\\n\\nHey everyone, we hope you had a fantastic summer! The Jomo team hustled to get the app ready for back-to-school season, squeezing it in between two ocean dips. This update has a lot of improvements—let's dive in.\\n\\n◆ ONE TAB TO RULE THEM ALL ◆\\n\\nWe’ve merged sessions and conditions into a single “Rules” tab. \\n\\nRules are now divided into three categories:\\n* Session rules block apps and websites during specific time intervals.\\n* Limit rules block apps and websites after reaching a usage limit (time, opens, etc.).\\n* Action rules block apps and websites until a specific action is completed (walk, spend X minutes on an app, manual completion, etc.).\\n\\nThis design should make managing and finding screen time rules easier. We can’t wait to have your feedback on this. Reach out through the app (Profile \u003e Messages \u003e Chat with us) or email us at hello@jomo.so to give us your opinion.\\n\\n◆ ADD NEW APPS/WEBSITES/OPTIONS DURING STRICT MODE ◆\\n\\n\u2028\u2028Your second all-time most requested feature is now in Jomo! You can now add apps, websites, or options to your blocklist even if your rule is in Strict Mode. You can also disable breaks in Strict Mode. \\n\\nThanks to everyone who gave feedback. We hope this makes adjusting your rules smoother.\\n\\n◆ 4 (!) NEW LANGUAGES ◆\\n\\nJomo is now available in Italian, German, Brazilian Portuguese, and Spanish.\\n\\nTo report a translation issue, go to Profile \u003e Settings \u003e Language \u003e Report translation issue.\\n\\nTo request a new language, go to Profile \u003e Settings \u003e Language \u003e Request new language.\\n\\n◆ OTHER IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* The interface got a summer makeover with a more modern and friendly design!\\n* Websites are now listed under Safari on the “Home” tab.\\n* We’ve made our block screens consistent across all rules and added 150+ new ones.\\n* We’ve made many small fixes and tweaks under the hood to improve your Jomo experience.\\n* We addressed a bug that stopped screen time data from displaying correctly in some languages.\\n* We fixed a crash caused by generating some emoji stickers.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-06\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-06T09:36:46Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.18\",\"releaseNotes\":\"**IF YOU’VE SET UP SHORTCUTS AND AUTOMATIONS USING JOMO**\\n\\nWe’ve improved our shortcut actions to be more versatile and powerful. Some actions might need resetting, so double-check any shortcuts and automations that rely on Jomo.\\n\\n◆ JOMO IS BACK FOR THE NEW SEASON  ◆\\n\\nHey everyone, we hope you had a fantastic summer! The Jomo team hustled to get the app ready for back-to-school season, squeezing it in between two ocean dips. This update has a lot of improvements—let's dive in.\\n\\n◆ ONE TAB TO RULE THEM ALL ◆\\n\\nWe’ve merged sessions and conditions into a single “Rules” tab. \\n\\nRules are now divided into three categories:\\n* Session rules block apps and websites during specific time intervals.\\n* Limit rules block apps and websites after reaching a usage limit (time, opens, etc.).\\n* Action rules block apps and websites until a specific action is completed (walk, spend X minutes on an app, manual completion, etc.).\\n\\nThis design should make managing and finding screen time rules easier. We can’t wait to have your feedback on this. Reach out through the app (Profile \u003e Messages \u003e Chat with us) or email us at hello@jomo.so to give us your opinion.\\n\\n◆ ADD NEW APPS/WEBSITES/OPTIONS DURING STRICT MODE ◆\\n\\n\u2028\u2028Your second all-time most requested feature is now in Jomo! You can now add apps, websites, or options to your blocklist even if your rule is in Strict Mode. You can also disable breaks in Strict Mode. \\n\\nThanks to everyone who gave feedback. We hope this makes adjusting your rules smoother.\\n\\n◆ 4 (!) NEW LANGUAGES ◆\\n\\nJomo is now available in Italian, German, Brazilian Portuguese, and Spanish.\\n\\nTo report a translation issue, go to Profile \u003e Settings \u003e Language \u003e Report translation issue.\\n\\nTo request a new language, go to Profile \u003e Settings \u003e Language \u003e Request new language.\\n\\n◆ OTHER IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* The interface got a summer makeover with a more modern and friendly design!\\n* Websites are now listed under Safari on the “Home” tab.\\n* We’ve made our block screens consistent across all rules and added 150+ new ones.\\n* We’ve made many small fixes and tweaks under the hood to improve your Jomo experience.\\n* We fixed a bug that stopped screen time data from displaying correctly in some languages.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-03T20:27:21Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.17\",\"releaseNotes\":\"**IF YOU’VE SET UP SHORTCUTS AND AUTOMATIONS USING JOMO**\\n\\nWe’ve improved our shortcut actions to be more versatile and powerful. Some actions might need resetting, so double-check any shortcuts and automations that rely on Jomo.\\n\\n◆ JOMO IS BACK FOR THE NEW SEASON  ◆\\n\\nHey everyone, we hope you had a fantastic summer! The Jomo team hustled to get the app ready for back-to-school season, squeezing it in between two ocean dips. This update has a lot of improvements—let's dive in.\\n\\n◆ ONE TAB TO RULE THEM ALL ◆\\n\\nWe’ve merged sessions and conditions into a single “Rules” tab. \\n\\nRules are now divided into three categories:\\n* Session rules block apps and websites during specific time intervals.\\n* Limit rules block apps and websites after reaching a usage limit (time, opens, etc.).\\n* Action rules block apps and websites until a specific action is completed (walk, spend X minutes on an app, manual completion, etc.).\\n\\nThis design should make managing and finding screen time rules easier. We can’t wait to have your feedback on this. Reach out through the app (Profile \u003e Messages \u003e Chat with us) or email us at hello@jomo.so to give us your opinion.\\n\\n◆ ADD NEW APPS/WEBSITES/OPTIONS DURING STRICT MODE ◆\\n\\n\u2028\u2028Your second all-time most requested feature is now in Jomo! You can now add apps, websites, or options to your blocklist even if your rule is in Strict Mode. You can also disable breaks in Strict Mode. \\n\\nThanks to everyone who gave feedback. We hope this makes adjusting your rules smoother.\\n\\n◆ 4 (!) NEW LANGUAGES ◆\\n\\nJomo is now available in Italian, German, Brazilian Portuguese, and Spanish.\\n\\nTo report a translation issue, go to Profile \u003e Settings \u003e Language \u003e Report translation issue.\\n\\nTo request a new language, go to Profile \u003e Settings \u003e Language \u003e Request new language.\\n\\n◆ OTHER IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* The interface got a summer makeover with a more modern and friendly design!\\n* Websites are now listed under Safari on the “Home” tab.\\n* We’ve made our block screens consistent across all rules and added 150+ new ones.\\n* We’ve made many small fixes and tweaks under the hood to improve your Jomo experience.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-02T10:32:56Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.16\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ VACATION 1 - SCREENS 0  ◆\\n\\nJoin our 'Vacation 1 - Screens 0' challenge and enjoy screen-free moments with loved ones. Use your vacation to disconnect from digital distractions and strengthen your bonds.\\n\\nFind a special session template under Rules \u003e Sessions \u003e Templates \u003e Vacation 1 - Screens 0. This event is in partnership with the Screenbreak newsletter.\\n\\n◆ SET HOW LONG APPS WILL BE BLOCKED ONCE YOUR TIME LIMIT IS REACHED [JOMO PLUS]  ◆\\n\\nIn this new version, we are releasing the most requested feature for the iOS app by the Jomo community.\\n\\nYou can now configure your app limit as follows: \\\"After X minutes of app usage time, block app for Y minutes.\\\"\\n\\nFor instance, if you’ve allocated 15 minutes for Instagram followed by a 2-hour block, you can use Instagram for 5 minutes, set your phone aside, return later for another 5 minutes, and so forth until you’ve used up the 15 minutes. Then Instagram will be blocked for 2 hours.\\n\\nWe believe this setting will help you create more sustainable time limits. We look forward to hearing your feedback!\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* If you encounter stability issues with time limits, you can turn off real-time monitoring for your limit. Open the detail screen for your limit and go to More \u003e Monitor usage in real time. Turning this off improves tracking reliability but disables the usage duration progress bar and reminders.\\n* We’ve fixed the “Complete Habit” shortcut.\\n* We’ve added a warning message when selecting blocked apps for the “Good Apps First” condition to help you avoid mistakes.\\n* Adjusted height for the “Trends” section on iPhone 12/13 mini for better readability.\\n* The strict mode confirmation alert is clearer and the strict mode password is no longer shown.\\n* You can now block app installations. Open your rule and go to Apps \u0026 Websites \u003e Additional options \u0026 websites \u003e App installations.\u2028\\n* A memory leak that could cause blocking screens to malfunction has been fixed. Thanks to Chris for reporting this problem.\\n* Blocking rules should work again for beta users.\\n* We've fixed a bug where disabling notifications for certain sessions was not properly taken into account.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-07-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-07-15T07:35:02Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.15\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ SET HOW LONG APPS WILL BE BLOCKED ONCE YOUR TIME LIMIT IS REACHED [JOMO PLUS]  ◆\\n\\nIn this new version, we are releasing the most requested feature for the iOS app by the Jomo community.\\n\\nYou can now configure your app limit as follows: \\\"After X minutes of app usage time, block app for Y minutes.\\\"\\n\\nFor instance, if you’ve allocated 15 minutes for Instagram followed by a 2-hour block, you can use Instagram for 5 minutes, set your phone aside, return later for another 5 minutes, and so forth until you’ve used up the 15 minutes. Then Instagram will be blocked for 2 hours.\\n\\nWe believe this setting will help you create more sustainable time limits. We look forward to hearing your feedback!\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* If you encounter stability issues with time limits, you can turn off real-time monitoring for your limit. Open the detail screen for your limit and go to More \u003e Monitor usage in real time. Turning this off improves tracking reliability but disables the usage duration progress bar and reminders.\\n* We’ve fixed the “Complete Habit” shortcut.\\n* We’ve added a warning message when selecting blocked apps for the “Good Apps First” condition to help you avoid mistakes.\\n* Adjusted height for the “Trends” section on iPhone 12/13 mini for better readability.\\n* The strict mode confirmation alert is clearer and the strict mode password is no longer shown.\\n* You can now block app installations. Open your rule and go to Apps \u0026 Websites \u003e Additional options \u0026 websites \u003e App installations.\u2028\\n* A memory leak that could cause blocking screens to malfunction has been fixed. Thanks to Chris for reporting this problem.\\n* Blocking rules should work again for beta users.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-06-29T08:15:01Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.14\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ SET HOW LONG APPS WILL BE BLOCKED ONCE YOUR TIME LIMIT IS REACHED [JOMO PLUS]  ◆\\n\\nIn this new version, we are releasing the most requested feature for the iOS app by the Jomo community.\\n\\nYou can now configure your app limit as follows: \\\"After X minutes of app usage time, block app for Y minutes.\\\"\\n\\nFor instance, if you’ve allocated 15 minutes for Instagram followed by a 2-hour block, you can use Instagram for 5 minutes, set your phone aside, return later for another 5 minutes, and so forth until you’ve used up the 15 minutes. Then Instagram will be blocked for 2 hours.\\n\\nWe believe this setting will help you create more sustainable time limits. We look forward to hearing your feedback!\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* If you encounter stability issues with time limits, you can turn off real-time monitoring for your limit. Open the detail screen for your limit and go to More \u003e Monitor usage in real time. Turning this off improves tracking reliability but disables the usage duration progress bar and reminders.\\n* We’ve fixed the “Complete Habit” shortcut.\\n* We’ve added a warning message when selecting blocked apps for the “Good Apps First” condition to help you avoid mistakes.\\n* Adjusted height for the “Trends” section on iPhone 12/13 mini for better readability.\\n* The strict mode confirmation alert is clearer and the strict mode password is no longer shown.\\n* You can now block app installations. Open your rule and go to Apps \u0026 Websites \u003e Additional options \u0026 websites \u003e App installations.\u2028\\n* A memory leak that could cause blocking screens to malfunction has been fixed. Thanks to Chris for reporting this problem.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-06-28T06:02:37Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.13\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ SET HOW LONG APPS WILL BE BLOCKED ONCE YOUR TIME LIMIT IS REACHED [JOMO PLUS]  ◆\\n\\nIn this new version, we are releasing the most requested feature for the iOS app by the Jomo community.\\n\\nYou can now configure your app limit as follows: \\\"After X minutes of app usage time, block app for Y minutes.\\\"\\n\\nFor instance, if you’ve allocated 15 minutes for Instagram followed by a 2-hour block, you can use Instagram for 5 minutes, set your phone aside, return later for another 5 minutes, and so forth until you’ve used up the 15 minutes. Then Instagram will be blocked for 2 hours.\\n\\nWe believe this setting will help you create more sustainable time limits. We look forward to hearing your feedback!\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* If you encounter stability issues with time limits, you can turn off real-time monitoring for your limit. Open the detail screen for your limit and go to More \u003e Monitor usage in real time. Turning this off improves tracking reliability but disables the usage duration progress bar and reminders.\\n* We’ve fixed the “Complete Habit” shortcut.\\n* We’ve added a warning message when selecting blocked apps for the “Good Apps First” condition to help you avoid mistakes.\\n* Adjusted height for the “Trends” section on iPhone 12/13 mini for better readability.\\n* The strict mode confirmation alert is clearer and the strict mode password is no longer shown.\\n* You can now block app installations. Open your rule and go to Apps \u0026 Websites \u003e Additional options \u0026 websites \u003e App installations.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-06-25T07:38:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.12\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ MEDITATE TO UNLOCK APPS (WITH APPLE HEALTH)  ◆\\n\\nA new Health Goal (highly requested!) is now available: Mindful Minutes.\\n\\nHealth Goals are Jomo's brand-new feature that encourages you to reach a specific activity goal to unlock apps.\\n\\nYou can now create a rule that says: \\\"If I spend 10 mindful minutes, unlock Instagram\\\" (100% customizable). Most meditation apps (Petit Bambou, Calm, Headspace, etc.) automatically add mindful minutes to Apple Health after each session.\\n\\nMindfulness invites you to live in the moment and experience the present. A great addition to Jomo!\\n\\nGo to Rules \u003e Conditions \u003e + \u003e To Unblock \u003e Health Goals to try it out.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have added three more health goals: water consumed, exercise minutes, and time spent in daylight.\\n* Open limits could reset to zero during the day without reason. This issue has been fixed.\u2028\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-06-05T09:03:50Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.11\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ NEW HEALTH GOALS: ACTIVE CALORIES, RUN, SWIM AND MORE  ◆\\n\\nIn this new version, we’re supporting new metrics for Health Goals:\\n\\n* Active calories\\n* Running distance\\n* Swimming distance\\n* Cycling distance\\n* Workout time\\n\\nAs a reminder, Health Goals is our brand-new feature that encourages you to reach a certain activity goal to unlock apps. For example, run 5 km to unlock your favorite mobile game. Go to Rules \u003e Conditions \u003e + \u003e To Unblock \u003e Health Goals to try it out.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-20T13:09:41Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.10\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ NEW CONDITIONS POWERED BY APPLE HEALTH (JOMO PLUS) ◆\\n\\n150 minutes of exercise per week, or two and a half hours—that’s the official recommendation from the World Health Organization. Yet 1.4 billion people fall short. Worse still, according to CDC, three out of four American adults are not getting enough exercise.\\n\\nTwo and a half hours a week may sound like a lot, but when compared to the 35 hours a week the average person spends on their phone, it's easy to see why we've become so sedentary. It's time to restore the balance!\\n\\nIn this new version, we're excited to announce the release of the most requested feature ever on Jomo: screen time rules linked to your physical activity. You read that right—we're introducing two brand-new types of conditions that integrate with Apple Health:\\n\\n* Health Goals: Reach a certain health goal to unlock apps. For example, walk 5000 steps to unlock your favorite mobile game.  Go to Rules \u003e Conditions \u003e + \u003e To Unblock \u003e Health Goals to try them.\\n* Dynamic Limits: It's simple — The more you exercise, the more time you unlock on certain apps. For example, you can start your day with 10 minutes of Instagram. Every 500 steps you walk earns you an extra minute. This is 100% customizable. Go to Rules \u003e Conditions \u003e + \u003e To Block \u003e Dynamic Limits to try them.\\n\\nWe're supporting two health metrics in this initial release: steps and pushes (for wheelchair users). Many more are coming in the future! If there is a specific metric you want to be added, contact us at hello@jomo.so.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* You can now use an “All except…” blocklist or an app group in a “Good Apps First” condition.\\n* To avoid confusion, whitespaces are now trimmed for passwords protecting strict mode.\\n* We've fixed an issue that could cause the app to freeze when the \\\"Rules\\\" tab was opened. Many thanks to MH and Gabriel for reporting this!\\n* We've corrected a bug where the specified interval was not correctly taken into account when scheduling a condition.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-10T08:37:01Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ “UNTIL DATE” OPTION FOR STRICT MODE, RULE STREAK AND CUSTOM SNOOZE LIMIT ◆\\n\\nIn this new version, we've added several upgrades to our blocking rules.\\n\\n**Strict Mode “Until Date“**\\n\\nYou can now lock your rule with Strict Mode until a specified time in the future. Simply select the new \\\"Until Date\\\" option when enabling Strict Mode and select the date and time of your choice. Thanks so much to Hermann, Philippe, Linden, and Mate for suggesting this.\\n\\n**Rule Streak**\\n\\nWe are now keeping track of how long a rule is held. As you may know, our goal with Jomo is to help you create resilient screen time rules that you can maintain in the long term. By showing that you've committed to a rule for 7, 30, 60, or even 365 days, we want to celebrate lasting screen time habits!\\n\\nYou can check your streak for a given rule by opening its detail screen. You can also show the streak directly in the rule card by going to Rules \u003e Rule Settings \u003e Display streak in rule card.\\n\\n**Custom Snooze Limits (Jomo Plus)**\\n\\nYou can customize the number of times you can snooze a rule or refresh a condition. To do this, go to Rules \u003e Rule Settings \u003e Quotas. You can update limits once per week. \\n\\nIn the latest version, we limited the number of snoozes to twice per week by default. We've removed this as you can now customize it to your liking.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We've fixed an issue with the \\\"Habit\\\" conditions where the checkbox would not appear until you force-restarted the app. Thanks to Hunter and Bridget for reporting this.\\n* We've fixed an issue where a \\\"Habit\\\" condition would reset on timezone change. Many thanks to Tristan for his feedback!\\n* We've revamped the screen time settings and the rule settings screens. They are still quickly accessible from the \\\"Home\\\" tab (for screen time settings) and from the \\\"Rules\\\" tab (for rule settings). You can also access both by going to Profile \u003e Settings.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-25T09:35:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ NEW CONDITIONS, LIMIT REMINDERS, STRICT MODE IMPROVEMENTS, AND MORE ◆\\n\\nIn this version, we've made many updates to our blocking rules based on hundreds of feedback from the Jomo community! Our goal? To help you set up smart screen time rules that stick in the long run.\\n\\nThank you again to everyone for helping us shape the most advanced app blocking system on iPhone/iPad; this version is **MADE BY YOU**.\\n\\n||| 3 NEW CONDITIONS\u2028 |||\\n\\n* Good Apps First: Prioritize the use of \\\"good\\\" apps before others. For example, spend 15 minutes reading on Books to unlock YouTube.\\n* Screen Time Limit: Block time-heavy apps after you've used your phone for a set period. For example, blocking social media or using it more intentionally after 1 hour of screen time.\\n* App Opens Limit: Block apps after opening them a specific number of times, such as blocking Mail after 5 opens daily.\\n\\n||| GENERAL ENHANCEMENTS FOR CONDITIONS |||\\n\\n* Breaks are now available on conditions! For example, you can allow yourself a few extra unlocks after you've reached your limit. Unlike native limits, it's 100% customizable!\\n* Reminders on Limits: Receive notifications before you reach your limit, or at regular intervals, to better manage your time.\\n* App groups are now available for conditions.\\n* You can now create reusable condition templates.\\n\\n|||  STRICT MODE IMPROVEMENTS |||\\n\\nYou can now choose when strict mode will be active. Three modes are available:\\n* While Blocking: Strict mode is active only during blocking. This is the default behaviour that you already know.\\n* Always On (Password): Strict mode remains active at all times until you enter a set password. This password can be configured by a friend or family member to keep you accountable, for example.\\n* Always On (Random Code): Strict mode remains active at all times until you enter a random code. You can choose the length of the code.\\n* You can now set the emergency mode code length, and snoozing is limited to twice every 7 days.\\n\\n|||  UI IMPROVEMENTS |||\\n\\n* A new design for the rule card.\\n* A simplified breaks configuration screen with helpful visuals.\\n* A completely redesigned \\\"Templates\\\" section in the \\\"Rules\\\" tab.\\n\\nWe can't wait for you to try out all these improvements! And it doesn't stop there - we'll be continuing to publish major updates to blocking rules over the coming weeks!\\n\\nAs always, please keep the feedback coming by reaching out through the app (Profile \u003e Messages \u003e Chat with us) or at hello@jomo.so. We've made major changes under the hood, so feel free to contact us if you encounter any issues.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-08T07:40:50Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ IMPORTANT MESSAGE FOR IOS 16 USERS ◆\\n\\nDue to technical reasons beyond our control, Jomo can no longer display detailed activity data (such as used applications) on iOS 16. We have updated the \\\"Home\\\" tab for iOS 16 users to accommodate these limitations. You can still view your total screen time for today, as well as access your average weekly screen time and new statistics about time saved with Jomo.\\n\\n**For an optimal experience on Jomo, we advise iOS 16 users to update their device to iOS 17. App blocking will continue to function correctly on iOS 16.**\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have fixed a bug that prevented app limits and estimated screen time from functioning correctly on iOS 17.4.\\n* A new \\\"Quick Sessions\\\" widget is now available and it is interactive. You will be able to start a blocking session right from your home screen.\\n* We've simplified the process of upgrading from a subscription to the lifetime plan. If you are interested in purchasing the lifetime plan, go to Profile \u003e Settings \u003e Manage Your Jomo Plus Plan \u003e Upgrade to Lifetime.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-03-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-03-04T23:42:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ SAVE TIME WITH APP GROUPS ◆\\n\\nIn this new version, we've added one of your most-requested features: APP GROUPS.\\n\\nWith App Groups, you can create reusable lists of apps and websites to block. You can easily use these groups in your sessions. When configuring a session, navigate to “Blocked Content” and then select “Link App Group”. The coolest part is that any changes made to a group, such as adding an app, will be updated in all sessions using that group!\\n\\nYou can create different groups for various needs, such as fun apps, work apps, or a detox mode that blocks almost everything.\\n\\nCurrently, app groups are only available for sessions.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have revamped our blocked content selection screen to improve legibility and reduce errors.\\n* We have added quick access to the “Healthy Alternatives” screen in the “Rules” tab.\\n* We have fixed a bug where multiple sessions with whitelists were not merging correctly (special thanks to Rayan for reporting this).\\n* We have introduced a new “Is Session Active? (By Name)” shortcut, which allows you to check the status of a session by its name, rather than by an identifier. This is useful if the session whose status you want to know is not necessarily scheduled.\u2028\\n* We have fixed an issue where the timer stayed stuck on the start break screen after going to the background.\\n* Two new shortcuts were added: \\\"RedirectIfSessionBlocking\\\" and \\\"RedirectIfConditionBlocking\\\". Thanks to these new shortcuts, you can block any app using Apple's Shortcuts app and synchronize the blocking status with a specific session or condition.\\n* We have improved troubleshooting in various scenarios (login, app picker issues, etc.).\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-04T15:09:10Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ SAVE TIME WITH APP GROUPS ◆\\n\\nIn this new version, we've added one of your most-requested features: APP GROUPS.\\n\\nWith App Groups, you can create reusable lists of apps and websites to block. You can easily use these groups in your sessions. When configuring a session, navigate to “Blocked Content” and then select “Link App Group”. The coolest part is that any changes made to a group, such as adding an app, will be updated in all sessions using that group!\\n\\nYou can create different groups for various needs, such as fun apps, work apps, or a detox mode that blocks almost everything.\\n\\nCurrently, app groups are only available for sessions.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have revamped our blocked content selection screen to improve legibility and reduce errors.\\n* We have added quick access to the “Healthy Alternatives” screen in the “Rules” tab.\\n* We have fixed a bug where multiple sessions with whitelists were not merging correctly (special thanks to Rayan for reporting this).\\n* We have introduced a new “Is Session Active? (By Name)” shortcut, which allows you to check the status of a session by its name, rather than by an identifier. This is useful if the session whose status you want to know is not necessarily scheduled.\u2028\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-23T09:49:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ START 2024 ON THE RIGHT FOOT WITH EXPERT TIPS ◆\\n\\nIn this first release of the year, we've introduced a new category of healthy alternatives: Expert Tips! Now, you can access inspiring quotes from leading productivity and screen time experts every time you open a blocked app.\\n\\nWe've incorporated insights from James Clear (\\\"Atomic Habits\\\"), Nir Eyal (\\\"Hooked,\\\" \\\"Indistractable\\\"), Cal Newport (\\\"Deep Work,\\\" \\\"Digital Minimalism\\\"), and many others. Additionally, you'll find advice from Clo S., a certified digital wellbeing coach at This Too Shall Grow. If you'd like us to include quotes from a specific book, or if you're involved in digital wellbeing or productivity and wish to be featured on our blog screens, please reach out at hello@jomo.so.\\n\\nWe have a lot of exciting things coming up in 2024 and we can’t wait to share more with you in the coming weeks. Let's continue to embrace the JOMO in 2024.\\n\\n**Happy New Year to all of you!**\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have fixed an issue involving duplicate notifications with blocking sessions started using shortcuts.\\n* We have enhanced our mechanism for blocking apps while still receiving notifications (many thanks to Boaz for all the feedback).\\n* The app limits can no longer be edited or deleted within 5 minutes following a refresh, as indicated in the alert message that appears when refreshing a limit. Special thanks to Alyssa for bringing this bug to our attention.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-04T13:51:27Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ OUR CHRISTMAS GIFT FOR YOU: JOMO ON MAC ◆\\n\\nYour incredible support this year has been a true gift to us. That's why Santa Jomo is thrilled to announce some great news: Jomo is now available on Mac! You can download it right now from the Mac App Store. Additionally, if you are a Jomo Plus member, your plan will seamlessly extend to the Mac app.\\n\\nWe are on a mission to help you manage your screen time and maintain focus across all your devices. The launch of our Mac app marks a significant step towards this goal. We're excited for you to try it and eager to hear your feedback.\\n\\n**Merry Christmas to you all!**\\n\\n—\\n\\nHere’s what you can do on Jomo Mac:\\n* Website Blocker: Block any website on the following browsers: Safari, Google Chrome, Arc, Opera, Microsoft Edge, and Brave Browser.\\n* App Blocker: Block any app on your Mac (e.g., Mail, Slack).\\n* Breaks: Take short, intentional breaks from blocking. Prevent mindless scrolling by using distracting websites and apps on a timer.\\n* Schedules: Schedule recurring blocking sessions, such as Monday to Friday during your work hours.\\n* Easy to set up: Start blocking apps and websites in just a few clicks. Using our templates, you can easily build a focus system that meets your specific needs.\\n* Secure: Jomo blocks apps and websites requiring minimal permissions. It is safe, precise, and doesn't slow down your Mac.\\n\\n—\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have fixed an issue with the \\\"Start Session\\\" shortcut that occurred with iOS 17.2.\\n* You will no longer receive notifications for sessions that are snoozed.\\n* We have improved the 'Pause Session' shortcut to ensure it considers all relevant break options you have configured.\\n* We have fixed a bug that previously made it impossible for some users to use Apple Sign-In.\\n* Special app icon for Christmas 2023.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-20T13:43:38Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ OUR CHRISTMAS GIFT FOR YOU: JOMO ON MAC ◆\\n\\nYour incredible support this year has been a true gift to us. That's why Santa Jomo is thrilled to announce some great news: Jomo is now available on Mac! You can download it right now from the Mac App Store. Additionally, if you are a Jomo Plus member, your plan will seamlessly extend to the Mac app.\\n\\nWe are on a mission to help you manage your screen time and maintain focus across all your devices. The launch of our Mac app marks a significant step towards this goal. We're excited for you to try it and eager to hear your feedback.\\n\\n**Merry Christmas to you all!**\\n\\n—\\n\\nHere’s what you can do on Jomo Mac:\\n* Website Blocker: Block any website on the following browsers: Safari, Google Chrome, Arc, Opera, Microsoft Edge, and Brave Browser.\\n* App Blocker: Block any app on your Mac (e.g., Mail, Slack).\\n* Breaks: Take short, intentional breaks from blocking. Prevent mindless scrolling by using distracting websites and apps on a timer.\\n* Schedules: Schedule recurring blocking sessions, such as Monday to Friday during your work hours.\\n* Easy to set up: Start blocking apps and websites in just a few clicks. Using our templates, you can easily build a focus system that meets your specific needs.\\n* Secure: Jomo blocks apps and websites requiring minimal permissions. It is safe, precise, and doesn't slow down your Mac.\\n\\n—\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* You will no longer receive notifications for sessions that are snoozed.\\n* We have improved the 'Pause Session' shortcut to ensure it considers all relevant break options you have configured.\\n* We have fixed a bug that previously made it impossible for some users to use Apple Sign-In.\\n* Special app icon for Christmas 2023.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-15T10:03:23Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ JOMO CELEBRATES ITS 1-YEAR ANNIVERSARY WITH A BRAND-NEW IDENTITY ◆\\n\\nJomo was released a year ago! Since our launch in October 2022, we have built one of the most powerful and comprehensive screen time tools for iPhone/iPad. \\n\\nWith several thousand active users worldwide, a rating of 4.8/5 from over 350 reviews, and recognition as one of the top 15 apps created by women in 2023 according to Apple, we are proud of what we have achieved. We’d like to say a big thank you for your continued support and feedback. We couldn’t have done it without you.\\n\\nBut this is only the beginning. We are on a mission to build the best app to keep your screen time and focus in check, day after day, on all of your devices!\\n\\nStarting with a refreshed identity:\\n* A more minimalist interface that reflects our vision for Jomo: simple, efficient, and modern.\\n* An upgraded home screen experience: now you can easily switch between different metrics (screen time, pickups, notifications), and phone-free times are better highlighted on the daily graph.\\n* Refined widgets.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* Live activities will now automatically terminate when a compatible session ends.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-01T08:19:31Z\"}],\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1609960918\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=871651128\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":146953216}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1609960918\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=871651128\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":146953216}]}],\"requires32bit\":f